            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worra gosa Lawi ka dira keesani keesa tau inded'ina; wonti akanatiifi worri qooda lafa tokole inqabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo ganni sadi hobae ch'ufa qooda mid'aani keesani ch'ufa gabaasa, dira keesani keesati olnaqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagaleeni tunini ta worra gosa Lawiti wonti akanatiifi worri qooda lafa inqabu: ammalle sagaleeni suni ta keessumatifi ta hiyyeeyitifi ta nad'eeni d'iirsi ira due ta dira keesaani keesa teetuti. Worri ha d'ufe nyaate quufuti. Waan kana tolcha, duuba AABBO Waaqi keesani waan isani tolchitani ch'ufa keesa isani eebisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
